# Local AI-client state (settings.local.json, caches) stays out, but .claude/skills/ is
# committed: those are symlinks into f11-wiki/.agents/skills/, and they're what makes the
# wiki's skills discoverable when a client starts here at the project root rather than
# inside f11-wiki/. Mirrors f11-wiki/.gitignore.
#
# Note the `*` — git can't re-include anything under an excluded *directory*, so `.claude/`
# would make the negation below impossible.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
